    "title": "Somerton Rotary Club's 75th Anniversary Gala on Dec. 6 | News | yumasun.com",
    "text": "The Somerton Rotary Club will celebrate 75 years of service to the community with an anniversary gala.\nThe event will take place on Saturday, Dec. 6, at the Cocopah Casino, featuring dinner, live music and a ceremony recognizing past presidents of the Somerton Rotary Club, whose leadership has been key to the club’s success and lasting impact on the community, according to a press release.",
